---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import {JUZ, SURAHS} from '../lib/pages';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Feedback from '../components/Feedback.astro';
import HowItWorks from '../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import '../styles/planner.css';
---
<Shell title="Hifz Planner"><section class="intro"><div class="intro-text"><h1>{learning.heading}</h1> <p>Estimate new pages and revision time for your study days.</p> <span class="pill neutral count-chip">604-page layout</span></div><img class="motif" src="/motif.svg" alt="" width="220" height="140" aria-hidden="true"/></section><div class="workspace"><section class="panel wizard" aria-label="Plan your memorization"><div class="panel-body"><ol class="steps" aria-label="Steps"><li data-step-tab="1" aria-current="step"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span> Your pages</li><li data-step-tab="2"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span> Study days</li><li data-step-tab="3"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span> Plan</li></ol><p class="step-status"><span id="step-label">Step 1 of 3</span></p><div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Wizard progress" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuemax="3" aria-valuenow="1"><span id="step-bar" style="width:33.3%"></span></div><form id="wizard" class="wizard-form" novalidate>
<fieldset class="wizard-step" data-step="1">
<legend tabindex="-1">What have you memorized?</legend>
<div class="wizard-fields">
<label class="field">Pages already memorized (0 to 603)<input id="memorized" name="memorized" type="number" value="0" min="0" max="603" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required/></label>
<label class="field">New pages you want to add<input id="goal" name="goal" type="number" value="20" min="1" max="604" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required/></label>
</div>
<p class="live-summary" id="live-summary" aria-live="polite">Enter your numbers</p>
<details class="drawer" id="choose-content">
<summary>Choose by juz or by surah</summary>
<p class="micro">Pages use the 604-page Hafs layout. Ticking a juz or surah fills in the number above.</p>
<p class="micro">Shared boundary pages count once. Typing a number clears the ticks; “Clear ticks” keeps the number.</p>
<fieldset class="pick-group"><legend>Juz (30)</legend><div class="pick-grid">
{JUZ.map(j => <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="juz" value={j.juz} id={`juz-${j.juz}`}/> <span>Juz {j.juz}, pages {j.pageStart}–{j.pageEnd}</span></label>)}
</div></fieldset>
<fieldset class="pick-group"><legend>Surahs (114)</legend><div class="pick-grid">
{SURAHS.map(s => <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="surah" value={s.surah} id={`surah-${s.surah}`}/> <span>{s.surah}. {s.name}, pages {s.pageStart}–{s.pageEnd}</span></label>)}
</div></fieldset>
<div class="actions"><button class="button ghost small" type="button" id="clear-ticks">Clear ticks</button><span class="micro" id="pick-count" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
</details>
<p class="step-error" id="error-1" role="alert"></p>
<div class="wizard-nav"><span></span><button class="button" type="button" data-next>Next</button></div>
</fieldset>
<fieldset class="wizard-step" data-step="2" hidden>
<legend tabindex="-1">Your week</legend>
<div class="wizard-fields">
<label class="field">Study days per week (1 to 7)<input id="days" name="days" type="number" value="5" min="1" max="7" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required/></label>
<label class="field">Minutes per study session<input id="minutes" name="minutes" type="number" value="45" min="1" max="1440" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required/></label>
<label class="field">Start date<input id="start" name="start" type="date" required/></label>
</div>
<div class="suggestion top-gap"><p class="micro"><strong>Ramadan pace (a suggestion):</strong> fewer new pages per session and a shorter review cycle, so more of your week goes to revision. It is a starting point, not a rule. Every value stays editable below.</p><button class="button ghost small" type="button" id="ramadan">Use the Ramadan pace suggestion</button></div>
<details class="drawer top-gap" id="assumptions">
<summary>Adjust assumptions</summary>
<p class="micro">These are your own estimates. The planner does not measure how well you remember anything.</p>
<div class="wizard-fields">
<label class="field">Minutes to learn one new page<input id="newMinutes" name="newMinutes" type="number" value="45" min="1" max="1440" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required/></label>
<label class="field">Minutes to review one page<input id="reviewMinutes" name="reviewMinutes" type="number" value="2" min="0.1" max="120" step="0.1" inputmode="decimal" required/></label>
<label class="field">How many new pages per session?<input id="pace" name="pace" type="number" value="0.5" min="0.01" max="20" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" required/></label>
<label class="field">How many study sessions until you review everything once?<input id="cycle" name="cycle" type="number" value="14" min="1" max="365" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required/></label>
</div>
</details>
<label class="check-label top-gap"><input id="remember" type="checkbox"/> Remember these answers for 30 days</label>
<p class="step-error" id="error-2" role="alert"></p>
<div class="wizard-nav"><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-back>Back</button><button class="button" type="button" data-next>Next</button></div>
</fieldset>
<fieldset class="wizard-step" data-step="3" hidden>
<legend tabindex="-1">Your plan</legend>
<fieldset class="vocab-setting"><legend>Labels for the checklist</legend><label class="check"><input type="radio" name="vocab" value="plain" checked/> Plain words: new lesson, recent revision, old revision</label><label class="check"><input type="radio" name="vocab" value="sabaq"/> Sabaq, sabqi, manzil</label></fieldset>
<div class="plan-tools"><div class="actions"><button class="button secondary small" type="button" id="missed">I missed a day</button></div><p class="micro" id="replan-note" role="status"></p><label class="check-label"><input id="remember-checks" type="checkbox"/> Remember my check-offs for 30 days</label><p class="micro" id="check-note" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
<div id="results" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div id="session-end"></div>
<p class="micro plan-feedback">Something wrong with this plan? <Feedback compact /></p>
<div class="wizard-nav"><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-back>Back</button><button class="button secondary" type="button" id="reset">Start again</button></div>
</fieldset>
</form>
</div></section> <aside class="sidebar"><HowItWorks><h3>What the planner assumes</h3><p>Your memorized pages ÷ review cycle = pages to review in each session. New study uses the remaining time.</p><p>Revision is spread evenly. The planner does not assess retention, difficulty, recitation accuracy, or teacher guidance.</p><h3>Steps</h3><ol><li>Enter the pages already memorized and the new pages you want to add. Pages use the 604-page Hafs layout, and you can tick juz or surahs instead.</li><li>Enter study days per week, minutes per session and a start date. Adjust the assumptions if you want.</li><li>Read this week’s checklist and the calendar, then download a CSV or calendar file, or print this week.</li></ol><p>Balance new pages with the pages you already know: your own estimates, shown in full.</p><p><a href="/sources/">Read the methodology ↗</a></p></HowItWorks></aside></div><div id="print-sheet" class="print-sheet"></div><script>import '../lib/app';</script></Shell>
